Describe an Amlogic image container (dt.img, dtbo.img, aml_upgrade_package.img)

Usage: android-doctor amlogic [OPTIONS] <INPUT>

Arguments:
  <INPUT>  The Amlogic container to describe

Options:
      --no-color  Never emit colour, even on a terminal (also honours the NO_COLOR environment variable)
  -h, --help      Print help
